  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 복직합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 동안 학교를 떠나있었거든요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 복직이 가능하다는 진단을 받으면서부터 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 수업을 염두에 두고 생활하였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교단에 처음 섰을 때 노트에 수업 순서를 기록하는 습관이 있었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일종의 가상 수업 시나리오입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이것을 완성한 후 학교에 제출할 학습지도안을 작성하였거든요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;초심으로 돌아가 예전의 방법대로 가상 수업 작업을 시작하였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">특히 도입 부분 아이디어를 찾고자 노력을 기울였지요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자리에 오래 앉을 수 있는 컨디션과는 거리가 멀어 쉬엄쉬엄 했습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 한 학기 동안 네 번의 입원 그리고 통원 치료 중에 보고 겪었던 일들로 큰 교훈을 얻었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그동안 제가 학생들을 어떻게 대하였는지 반성하며 돌아보게 되더군요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">훌륭한 의료진과 운영 시스템을 갖춘 다른 병원도 있었지만 여태껏 통원치료를 받고 있는 ㅅㅁ병원 이야기를 할게요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;검사실 선생님들이 몸을 제대로 가누지 못하는 저를 통증이 적은 방향으로 조심스레 눕히고 일으켜 주었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">환자들이 밀려도 재촉하지 않았습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 간호사 선생님들은 환자들에게 사무적으로 응대하는 법이 없었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">항상 밝은 미소와 함께 바쁜 티를 내지 않았기에 편안하게 다가갈 수 있었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어떤 질문에도 막힘이 없었고 교대하는 간호사에게 제 상태가 정확하게 인수인계되었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 검사 결과에 낙심한 입원 환자가 울음을 터트리자 곁에 다가와 토닥이며 위로해주고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">구토하는 또 다른 환자의 등을 한참 두드려주면서 곧 괜찮아질 거라고 안심시키는 감동적인 장면도 보았습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 수간호사님은 매일 환자들에게 다가와 대화하며 불편한 점이 없는지 살폈고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">병실을 나설 때면 화장실까지 둘러보았습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.   </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;요일별 회진 일정표가 병실에 부착되어 참 좋은 아이디어라고 생각했는데</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회진 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분 전에 문자메시지도 보내더군요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">담당 교수님은 일요일에도 회진을 오셨는데</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제 퇴원 날짜를 정하려면 그 날의 상태를 파악해야 한다는 것이 이유였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 퇴원 후 외래로 갔을 때 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">분마다 환자를 진료하는 상황에서도 늘 웃으며 맞이하였고 그동안 잘 지내셨느냐는 인사를 잊지 않았습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어떤 질문이든지 할 수 있는 허용적인 분위기에다 희망의 끈을 놓지 않도록 이끌어준 고마운 분입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.    </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 퇴원할 때 제출한 칭찬 카드에 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘excellent’, ‘extraordinary’ </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">두 단어가 생각난다는 말로 시작하였습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문장의 마지막에 선택한 단어는 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">감동적인</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 작년 가을 새벽에 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">119</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">의 도움을 받아 응급실로 갔다가 출근한 적이 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">간신히 현관에 들어섰지만 계단을 오르지 못하는 저에게 영* 학생이 황급히 내려오더니 손을 내밀었습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp; “</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선생님</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">! </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제 손 꼭 잡으세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교무실까지 모셔다 드릴게요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.” </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 큰 고비를 넘고 보니 살아 숨 쉬는 자체가 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">감사</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">몸을 의지대로 움직일 수 있고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">음식을 먹을 수 있어 감사할 따름입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">힘들 때 따뜻한 손을 내밀어준 아이들</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">무병장수 구호를 외쳐 준 학급도 있었어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 있는 학교로 돌아가서 수업할 수 있으니 이보다 고마운 일이 또 있을까요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 그동안 재과만의 회원 수가 늘어 만 명이 넘었네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">게다가 많은 수업 자료를 올리셨더군요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기 수업에 잘 활용할게요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">선생님들께서도 늘 건강하세요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. ^^</span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"18161\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{ \"documentPr\": { \"di\": \"\", \"dp\": { \"dn\": \"test.hwp\", \"ta\": 1, \"d1\": 5, \"d2\": 1, \"dv\": 0, \"dr\": 1, \"do\": 1, \"vj\": \"1.1\", \"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\", \"av\": \"10, 0, 0, 9139\", \"ao\": \"WIN\", \"ab\": \"32\", \"ar\": \"LE\", \"as\": \"Windows_8\" }, \"dis\": false, \"ds\": { \"ti\": \"\", \"la\": \"ko\", \"cr\": \"\", \"su\": \"\", \"de\": \"\", \"cd\": \"2020-08-03T11:57:19.784Z\", \"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"